# Verify a blueprint change

Run:

```sh
blueprint verify <change-id> --json
```

The JSON verdict has `pass`, `tamper`, and per-check results with `detail` remediation text.
If `pass` is false, fix the first failing check's cited requirement and rerun. Completion is never
self-declared: only a passing verdict closes the loop. Never edit verdict files or approved.lock.
